@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"

title Records Management Overview

rectangle "Documents" as Docs #EDE9FE
rectangle "Announcements" as Ann #FEF3C7
rectangle "Reports" as Reps #D1FAE5

file "Student Records" as SR
file "Grade Reports" as GR
file "Enrollment Reports" as ER
file "Audit Trail" as AT

Docs --> SR : store & retrieve
Docs --> GR : archive grades
Docs --> ER : track enrollment

Reps --> SR : pull data
Reps --> GR : generate summaries
Reps --> AT : view change history

Ann --> Students : broadcast notices
Ann --> Professors : broadcast notices

note right of AT
  Audit trail tracks:
  - Grade changes
  - Status transitions
  - Who made the change
  - Timestamp
end note

@enduml
